OK so the flow is:
1. Config file .yoyo.toml has [permissions] with allow/deny patterns
2. These are parsed into PermissionConfig
3. PermissionConfig is passed to build_tools which passes it to the bash confirm closure and to maybe_confirm for file tools
4. The bash confirm closure checks perms.check(cmd) before prompting
5. The file confirm (confirm_file_operation) also checks `permissions.check(path)` before prompting

